          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God [the merciful and compassionate]</li>\n<li>May God per[petuate the the reign of my master the illustrious waz\u012br]</li>\n<li>The most righteous, commander of the forces, the leader [the protector of the judges of Muslims]</li>\n<li>[And the guide of the du\u02bf\u0101t of the faith[ful]</li>\n<li>Commander of the faithful, and perpetuate [</li>\n<li>his commands and rulings [</li>\n<li>He asks that benefaction be extended on him [and kindness be shown to him]</li></ol>\n",
